  "releaseNotes": "Full release notes: https://github.com/rafalka/MauiSkiaUi/blob/v1.9.0/CHANGELOG.md#190\n\nNew features\n- Tile layout\n- Core state container\n- Core expander\n- Core nodes scale each axis\n- Password reveal\n- Reorder from a drag handle\n\nBreaking changes\n- Animating one scale axis of a Core node scales that axis only: an SkUiViewAnimation (or a Core shimmer's state change animation) of ScaleX or ScaleY on a Core node used to scale both axes, or was rejected; it now scales its own axis, as on SkUi\\* views and in MAUI. Animate Scale to scale both.",
